      en: ["Capital of the Est Region", "Founded in the 18th century by Diaba Lompo", "Cultural center of the Gourmantché people", "Gateway to the W and Arly National Parks", "Population of approx. 73,000 (2019)", "Famous for local honey and 'Fada' fabric"],
