      en: ["Capital of the Plateau-Central Region", "Home to the Ziniaré Wildlife Park", "Birthplace of former President Blaise Compaoré", "Major center for granite quarrying", "Population of approx. 33,000 (2019)", "Located 35 km northeast of Ouagadougou"],
